1128
01:22:51,846 --> 01:22:54,224
[Nick] What do you mean,
where 'd it come from ?

1129
01:22:54,265 --> 01:22:56,685
[Fetcher]
Egg comes rollin' along, happy as Larry.

1130
01:22:56,768 --> 01:22:59,229
It's wonderin'
where 'd it come from ?

1131
01:22:59,270 --> 01:23:02,190
Without a chicken, you get
no egg to come rollin 'along.

1132
01:23:02,273 --> 01:23:05,193
[Nick] Well, conversely, without
an egg to hatch into the chicken,

1133
01:23:05,276 --> 01:23:08,196
there will be no chicken
to lay the other egg
that hatches into the chicken...

1134
01:23:08,279 --> 01:23:10,740
that lays the egg
I mentioned in the first place.

1135
01:23:10,782 --> 01:23:14,202
- So w e got two eggs now?
- [Nick] No, we 're still talking
about the very first egg.

1136
01:23:14,285 --> 01:23:17,747
- [Fetcher] But what happened
about the very first chicken ?
- He's in the very first egg !

1137
01:23:17,831 --> 01:23:20,750
- Aren't you listenin'?
- [Rocky]Uh, guys. Guys ?

1138
01:23:20,834 --> 01:23:23,253
Tryin' to enjoy paradise
Over here.

1139
01:23:23,336 --> 01:23:25,380
- Oh, sorry, guv.
- Beg your pardon.

1140
01:23:25,463 --> 01:23:28,591
- Won't happen again. [Chuckles]
- [Rocky] Thanks.

1141
01:23:28,675 --> 01:23:30,927
- [Mutters] Git face.
- [Mutters] Pillock.

1142
01:23:31,011 --> 01:23:34,472
[Nick] Thinks he's such a big shot
'cause he's go this name on a poster.

1143
01:23:34,514 --> 01:23:36,933
These showbiz folk
are all the same.

1144
01:23:37,017 --> 01:23:39,936
- [Fetcher] Yeah, the rats
are the stars, actually.
- Yeah, of course they are.

1145
01:23:40,020 --> 01:23:42,939
- We do all the work,
he gets all the credit.
- But he does get all the birds.

1146
01:23:43,023 --> 01:23:45,108
- He gets everything.
- Yes, he does. Everything.

1147
01:23:45,191 --> 01:23:47,152
- You said it, mate.
- I know.
